import{_ as e,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 854 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 854 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism","no":854,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Myriad-Rank Republicanism","Equal Uplift Right","Philosophical Foundation","Equality of All Beings"],"related":["05-Myriad Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program","77-Establishment of Myriad-Rank Republicanism","50-Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview","853-Anti-Predation Ultimate Argument"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0854_模块4-超脱者与哲学-万族共和哲学基础.md","filePath":"en/0854_模块4-超脱者与哲学-万族共和哲学基础.md"}'),o={name:"en/0854_模块4-超脱者与哲学-万族共和哲学基础.md"};function s(r,i,l,u,h,d){return t(),a("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-854-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-philosophical-foundation-of-myriad-rank-republicanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 854 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-854-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-philosophical-foundation-of-myriad-rank-republicanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 854 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Foundation of Myriad-Rank Republicanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 50, 77, 853</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-a-plant-spirit-and-a-supreme-strong-one-are-equal-in-uplift-right" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why a plant spirit and a supreme strong one are equal in uplift right <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-a-plant-spirit-and-a-supreme-strong-one-are-equal-in-uplift-right" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why a plant spirit and a supreme strong one are equal in uplift right&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview defaults: the strong should take more, the weak should yield. This is not bad people being bad, but its cosmology stipulates so — power determines status, status determines everything. Heng Yuan Zhou must overthrow this philosophically: <strong>all beings, regardless of strength, clan, life form, possess equal uplift qualification.</strong> This is not warmth, but a demonstrated cosmic axiom. This entry explains: why Myriad-Rank republicanism holds, and what its philosophical foundation actually is.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally argue <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> itself; it and <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> are two sides of the same coin — not recognizing equality makes predation reasonable; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> is republicanism&#39;s direction; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires republicanism not become suppressing difference; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires republicanism&#39;s argument be self-consistent.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-equality-s-root-uplift-right-is-the-most-basic-right-to-life" tabindex="-1">I. Equality&#39;s Root: Uplift Right Is the Most Basic Right to Life <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-equality-s-root-uplift-right-is-the-most-basic-right-to-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Equality&#39;s Root: Uplift Right Is the Most Basic Right to Life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s first philosophical cornerstone is Document 08&#39;s assertion — <strong>in a cultivation civilization, uplift right is the right to life.</strong> If a being is even deprived of &quot;having a road to walk,&quot; before cosmic-level danger he is effectively sentenced to suspended death. Therefore guaranteeing every being a road of uplift is not charity, but preserving life. Equality is not &quot;I yield to you,&quot; but &quot;I cannot kill you.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-the-strong-may-not-monopolize-uplift" tabindex="-1">II. Why the Strong May Not Monopolize Uplift <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-the-strong-may-not-monopolize-uplift" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why the Strong May Not Monopolize Uplift&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s second cornerstone is monopoly&#39;s inevitable failure:</p><ul><li><strong>Monopoly breaks circulation</strong>: the strong monopolize knowledge and resources; Myriad Ranks&#39; universal evolution is stuck; circulation dries up (entry 852);</li><li><strong>Monopoly breeds predation</strong>: monopoly itself is predation institutionalized; entry 853 already argues its doom;</li><li><strong>Monopoly exhausts the strong</strong>: one person monopolizes everything; ultimately he alone must shoulder all causality and responsibility — this is precisely Shi Hao&#39;s &quot;sole decision over eons&quot; loneliness.</li></ul><p>The more the strong monopolize, the more fragile he himself becomes. <strong>Republicanism is not mercy to the weak, but protection of the strong.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-equality-is-not-equalization-republicanism-and-difference" tabindex="-1">III. Equality Is Not Equalization: Republicanism and Difference <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-equality-is-not-equalization-republicanism-and-difference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Equality Is Not Equalization: Republicanism and Difference&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism is most easily misunderstood as &quot;everyone is the same.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou clarifies (Documents 05, 26):</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>What Is Equal</th><th>What Difference Is Allowed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Uplift qualification</td><td>All beings have a road</td><td>Progress fast or slow</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge access</td><td>Methods public network-wide</td><td>Mastery deep or shallow</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational weight</td><td>Distributed by contribution</td><td>Large contribution, high weight</td></tr><tr><td>Dignity</td><td>All life respected</td><td>Life forms vastly different</td></tr></tbody></table><p>What is equal is &quot;bottom-line qualification,&quot; not &quot;actual progress.&quot; This is why republicanism does not contradict more-work-more-pay (Document 06) — <strong>qualifications equal for all, rewards distributed by labor.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-republicanism-s-hyper-multiverse-meaning" tabindex="-1">IV. Republicanism&#39;s Hyper-Multiverse Meaning <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-republicanism-s-hyper-multiverse-meaning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Republicanism&#39;s Hyper-Multiverse Meaning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism is not a planet&#39;s political arrangement; it is the hyper-multiverse cosmic organizational principle:</p><ul><li>Between cosmoses, no cosmos is higher than another;</li><li>Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages, no life form is &quot;lower&quot;;</li><li>Civilizational weight is a ruler measuring contribution, not a ruler measuring &quot;racial superiority.&quot;</li></ul><p>This seals off the old world&#39;s &quot;high civilization conquers low civilization&quot; theory — <strong>in Heng Yuan Zhou, no one is born higher than another.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: recognizing Myriad Ranks&#39; equality releases the potential stuck by monopoly, maximizing civilization&#39;s evolution baseplate</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: republicanism from the root negates &quot;the strong take more,&quot; pulling out predation&#39;s theoretical basis</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo grace system ties uplift right to one person&#39;s mood; Heng Yuan Zhou makes uplift right a Myriad Ranks&#39; law-level right</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages, all life forms equal; 99% coverage is republicanism&#39;s direct fulfillment</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: republicanism&#39;s argument, institutions, and civilizational-weight distribution all public and queryable</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-republicanism-s-practical-test-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Republicanism&#39;s Practical Test and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-republicanism-s-practical-test-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Republicanism&#39;s Practical Test and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s philosophical foundation ultimately must be tested in practice. The anchor network monitors: whether each clan&#39;s uplift rate tends toward balance, whether bottom-up flow is unobstructed, whether civilizational-weight distribution is truly by contribution not by race. The transcended one&#39;s work to drive republicanism&#39;s landing is counted into civilizational weight by its effect of &quot;turning equality from text into reality.&quot; Any discrimination or monopoly signal in republicanism&#39;s operation is captured by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision and triggers correction. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm protects equality with laws and corrects deviation with supervision, Myriad-Rank republicanism is no longer only a philosophical ideal, but a daily operating real institution.</p><p>Especially emphasize: Axiom 6&#39;s landing gives this equality harder confidence — since everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, the weak simply need not survive by attaching to the strong or depending on monopoly; equality is no longer a concession to the strong, but every being&#39;s birthright.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s philosophical foundation answers &quot;by what right is a plant spirit equal to the supreme strong one.&quot; The answer is: because uplift right is the right to life, because monopoly inevitably self-destructs, because republicanism is not equalization but &quot;bottom-line equality + distribution by labor.&quot; Once this argument holds, the strong can no longer defend predation with &quot;I am strong so I should take more.&quot; Myriad-Rank republicanism is no longer an idealistic slogan, but cosmology&#39;s only sustainable organizational principle. This is the philosophical root of all &quot;every rank has a road&quot; promises.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/77-万族共和成立.html">Entry 77 · Establishment of Myriad-Rank Republicanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">Entry 50 · Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/853_模块4-超脱者与哲学-反掠夺终极论证.html">Entry 853 · Anti-Predation Ultimate Argument</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=e(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
